WEBVTT

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:14.010
COOL & CASUAL SECTION

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.010
That's a nice color.

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:50.270
Happy Birthday, Pinko.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:52.480
Pinko?

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:55.070
This is big!

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:56.490
CUFFED WRISTS

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.030
I'm happy, but you surprised me.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.370
A-Actually, I got you a present, too.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.870
Hiroe and I picked out this hairpin.

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:05.710
The same as Hana!

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.830
Happy B, Eiko!

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.340
Thank you, Hana and Tama.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:11.590
Can I put it on?

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.210
Yeah, go ahead.

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:14.510
You do it, too, Hana!

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.550
O-Okay!

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:19.430
Thank you.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:26.140
May I win the limited concert tickets,
may I win the limited concert tickets!

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.520
Your head looks kind of auspicious,
so it slipped out!

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:31.770
Now you, Hana!

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:39.280
May Eiko have a happy year.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.200
E-Eiko?

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.370
Thank you, I'm touched.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.540
You're a good girl, Hana.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:52.340
Jeez, if Hana is a good girl,
that makes me look like a bad girl.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:55.920
Y-You're not a bad girl at all, Tama!

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:57.800
Tama?

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.890
You're totally a good girl, Hana!

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:02.510
She is, isn't she?

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:08.140
Hana, you're adorable! Extremely cute!

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.940
Yeah, she is cute.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:11.440
Cute.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:15.480
She's bashful.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:16.780
She sure is.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.570
What the hell is that?

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:23.120
Are you Pinko Tokura?

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.330
Let's stop with the "Pinko" before it sticks.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:29.460
Tokura...

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:31.580
Y-Yes?

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.960
You think wearing a jumble of accessories
while you're young is stylish,

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:39.170
but you'll definitely regret it
ten years from now.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:41.840
No, you've got the wrong idea.
It's not like that.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.390
It's Eiko's birthday!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:45.930
Birthday?

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:49.100
I see. So that's why you're wearing
the festive outfit, huh?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.190
What is this?

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.100
All I sense is malice.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.690
No malice at all.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.860
I'm not thinking you're pretending
like you're popular. Not at all.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:01.110
You're awful, Kiyose.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.450
Don't call me by my name.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:07.410
Well, Happy Birthday, Tokura.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.410
I've got a present for you, too.

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.920
Here, hold still.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:14.500
Okay.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.300
How's that? Are you touched?

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:23.430
Teacher, this is obviously a paper clip.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:27.010
Relax. It belonged to me,
so there's no need to return it.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.890
This makes me so happy.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.770
I appreciate your kindness!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.020
Give it back.

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:38.860
Huh? Didn't you say
I didn't have to return it?

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:43.860
Remove them all from your head
before first period starts, Pinko.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.160
I said to stop calling me that!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:53.870
Ms. Enami really pulled your chain, Eiko!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.670
Yeah. That's my type.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.380
That's your type?

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.300
The other day, too,

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:05.720
I said to her, "Let's become friends
after I graduate," but...

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.220
<i>After you graduate,
I'll become your former teacher,</i>

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.600
<i>not your friend.</i>

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.230
That's what I love about her!

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.980
I don't know
how she finds that appealing,

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.440
but that's what I like about Eiko.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:29.580
LET'S KEEP IT CLEAN

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:37.880
Kamu?

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:43.260
Happy Birthday.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:45.510
Oh, this timing?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:46.890
Purposely.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:48.760
Purposely?

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.010
Then here, put it on.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:03.940
A ring.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.990
Purposely, because I thought
they might get you hairpins.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.160
It's beautiful!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:11.870
Thank you, Kamu.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:12.910
Yep.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:17.040
Say, this ring would fit
your ring finger, wouldn't it?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.290
I don't know.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.250
MONTHLY ACTIVITIES SCHEDULE

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.090
I brought it, Teacher.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.250
Thanks.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.760
I saw your mother recently.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.010
She asked me to take good care of you.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.760
R-Really?

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:34.720
Um...

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.520
How's school going?
Has anything bad happened?

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.020
No.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.650
Um, it's fun!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:48.150
At first, I was nervous
that I wouldn't get used to it.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:52.700
But now it seems fine. Um...

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.450
It's like a kind atmosphere.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.580
Or I have gotten used to it.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:03.920
More than getting used to it,
I'd say it's because you made friends.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.350
D-Do you think so?

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.720
That's what it looks like to me.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:20.980
But it's amazing!

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.230
You got a hairpin
from all of our classmates!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.530
You didn't plan that
with everyone in advance?

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.740
No, not at all.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:33.740
All of our hearts became one!
It's a miracle!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:37.870
This kind of thing may never happen
again until graduation!

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.500
It was fun!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.080
Birthday!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.290
It's a fond memory now!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:45.960
Eiko's hairpins!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:49.800
You're disregarding the class trip
and focusing on my hairpins?

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:55.140
The hairpin you always wear
is so pretty, Eiko!

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:56.850
Really?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.060
It suits you.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.730
The mature sparkling is like very Eiko!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.310
Really? Thank you.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.110
Where did you buy it? C'mon, c'mon!

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:07.980
It's a secret!

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.950
Is it a well-known store
you want to keep hidden?

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:18.290
I sense absolute force that won't let me
go even one step closer!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:24.290
Being a mysterious woman with real secrets
is the key to your popularity, huh?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.290
Are you okay with that, Kamu?

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:29.300
There should be a limit to her popularity!

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.050
I'm happy that everyone likes Eiko.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:34.180
I see!

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:37.720
You're like, as long as she comes home
to my port in the end...

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:38.680
Is that like a ballad?

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:44.310
Or like a dog that leaves at night
but returns to the doghouse in the morning.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.060
A dog?

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:47.770
Woof!

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.120
Ah, I drank too much.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.090
T-Tokura?

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.680
This is my place, right?

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:19.760
Good morning, Teacher.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.190
I guess I just fell asleep like that.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:28.770
Sorry.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.230
Would you take these off?

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.190
S-Sure.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.610
Thank you.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.200
Oh, I'm going to use your bathroom.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.500
<i>What is this?</i>

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:53.800
Thank you.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.590
Do you have a hangover?

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:59.930
Hey, what happened?
How is it that you're here?

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.430
You don't remember?

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.360
Come on, walk.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:09.810
Ms. Enami!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:12.780
Good evening.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.240
Yo...

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.950
Are you a student of Enami's?

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.740
Yes. Hello.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.740
It doesn't take much
for her to get wasted.

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:24.450
Seeing her like this
and so weak is hilarious, isn't it?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:26.040
Shut up.

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.130
Yes, Nishimura here.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:31.800
Thanks for earlier.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.800
- Yes. Thank you.
- She's cute drunk.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.890
Enami, wake up!

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:44.350
I have to go back to that bar
and pick up something we left behind. Hey!

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:47.270
How about I walk her home?

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:48.810
Are you sure?

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:49.690
Yes.

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:53.270
Well, it's the apartment building right there.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.280
Teacher, you're home.

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.280
Please unlock the door.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:11.540
Nishimura, for some reason,
you look like Tokura tonight.

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:13.500
Why?

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.590
Probably because I am Tokura?

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.470
I see, you are Tokura.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.720
Yes, I'm Tokura.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.350
Are you okay, Teacher?

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.440
Yeah.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.360
Tokura is my student, right?

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.240
Are we still talking about that?

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.700
Hey, is Tokura cute?

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.830
No, she's not cute.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.410
You didn't even think about it.
That's awful!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.960
Tokura...

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.500
What is it with her?

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:54.750
Hey, what do you think?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.920
Oh, I don't know.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:59.380
One thing I can say for sure.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.630
Uh-huh...

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.390
She's not cute.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:03.720
Oh...

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.910
Here, Teacher. Water.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.540
Well, I'll get going.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.040
You're leaving?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.000
Yeah, of course.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.920
You're leaving?

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.130
Do you want me to stay?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.090
Do you want me to stay?

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.710
That's what I'm asking.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.970
If you want me to stay, I will.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.720
If you want me to stay...

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.100
I will stay.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.600
You'll stay?

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:53.350
This is the sofa cover.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.860
You're pretty fussy for a drunk.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.610
Here, lie down.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:01.110
I bet you'll do that...

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:05.370
If I fall asleep, I bet you'll write
on my face or play some other prank.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.410
I won't do that.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.700
I don't trust you.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.120
All right, I'll tie you up.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:13.960
Put your hands out.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.080
Okay.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.880
And that's what happened.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.840
Well, yeah. I'm totally to blame.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:23.880
I'm to blame...

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.470
but you should've resisted a little more.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:30.430
It just kept getting more interesting.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.520
As long as it's interesting,
anything goes with you?

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:34.520
Pretty much.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:37.560
Tokura...

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:38.770
Yes?

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.820
I'm sorry for being a burden.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.410
Y-You've become meek!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.080
Tokura, how dare you...

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.200
Sorry.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.370
I bet this is what she wanted...

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.710
Wait, Tokura...

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:58.750
Yes?

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.420
You stayed here
without your parents' permission?

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:03.010
No problem there.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:06.890
I sent them a text saying
I was sleeping over at a friend's house.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.140
Oh...

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.770
Tokura, you were pretty tied up
the whole night.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.520
When did you send a text?

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:18.270
You were able to get out of them
yourself, weren't you?

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:23.400
Jeez, I'm gonna give up drinking.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:26.280
But you're a cute drunk, Teacher.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.660
Shut up.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:34.410
One thing,
you'd better not skip school today.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.670
I'll go home, change, then go to school.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.210
Oh.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:42.170
Teacher, if you want coffee,
I'll make it for you.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.590
Go ahead and wash your face
in the meantime.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.180
Can I take a shower, too?

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.800
As you like.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.300
Don't go through my stuff.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.600
If you're worried,
you could tie me up again.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:54.930
Don't bring that up again.

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.640
You know how to use it?

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.520
Yes. I make coffee for my mom, so...

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:03.020
Then sorry for the trouble, but thanks.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.920
I feel much better.

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:23.840
The coffee's ready.

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:24.920
Thank you.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.220
You don't eat breakfast, Teacher?

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.430
Sometimes I do, sometimes I don't.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:34.810
Oh, but you should have breakfast.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:37.520
You'd better not be on some diet
where you skip breakfast.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:38.810
I won't.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:43.860
This is good.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.690
Really?

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.150
I'm glad!

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.070
You don't take sugar?

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:53.530
No, I drink it black.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:55.370
That's cheeky for a high school girl.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.830
You drink it black, too, huh, Teacher?

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.410
Because I'm an adult.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.630
An adult who gets drunk
and is looked after by a student.

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:08.170
I think it's good. In a cute way.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.670
That doesn't make me happy.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.930
Thank you for the coffee.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:21.100
I'd better get home and change.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.560
If you're late to class,
I'm marking you tardy.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.020
Right!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.190
I'm on duty today.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.150
Really?

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.240
I made a plan with Hana
to meet at school early.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.280
You guys are serious.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:37.540
Well, as a teacher, that's appreciated.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:41.410
If I take a shower,
I'm not sure I'll make it in time.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.290
I wonder if I smell sweaty.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:50.170
You smell good.

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.090
Really? That's good to hear.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:59.560
Then if you'll excuse me...
I'll see you at school.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.980
Yeah. Go straight home.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.240
<i>What?</i>

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:12.070
<i>What is this feeling,</i>

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:15.740
<i>like I was winning, but in the last game,
my opponent pulled off an upset?</i>

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.330
Teacher, good morning!

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:25.250
Oh, Ichinose...

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.710
I gathered all the print-outs.

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:29.460
Thanks.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.380
Hana!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.590
You forgot one!

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.180
Thank you, Eiko!

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:36.340
Not at all.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:39.060
Good morning, Teacher.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:41.850
Hi.

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:43.980
Good morning.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:45.980
I know. You're laying it on thick.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:49.360
Good. Mor. Ning.

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:51.860
Morning.

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.900
There you go.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:54.860
Don't get cocky.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.570
Ow...

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:02.660
Hey, Tokura...

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:03.830
Eiko?

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:07.630
Teacher, this... this necklace...

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:10.300
Oh, I bought it yesterday.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:15.010
I was killing time while waiting for my friend
and saw it in a shop window.

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.510
That's a pretty necklace!

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:20.600
Yeah. Nice color, right?

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:23.180
Tokura?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:25.850
Hey, Tokura...

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:26.940
What's wrong?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.060
Nothing!

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:31.400
Um, Teacher...

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:35.240
It looks really good on you.

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.110
Th-Thanks...

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.450
Well, shall we do our duties?

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:40.700
Let's go, Hana.

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:41.830
Oh, right.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.130
Um, Eiko...

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:54.420
Uh, when you were talking
to the teacher back there,

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.510
I had the feeling something happened.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:00.550
Hana...

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.760
Y-Yes?

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:07.310
Can I trust you to keep a secret?

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.610
Isn't it nice up here?

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:19.740
This is my secret spot.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:26.620
<i>Secret, secret spot, something
I can't tell anyone, a dangerous story!</i>

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:28.120
Hana?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.840
Eiko, it's okay!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.800
Whatever happened, I'm on your side!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:37.970
Wh-What?

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.260
It'll be okay!

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:44.010
Don't worry. It's nothing that dark.

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:46.980
I see.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.400
So listen...

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:54.020
Teacher was wearing a necklace, right?

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:55.030
Yeah.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:58.650
I'm the one who made it.

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:05.620
My hobby is making accessories.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.830
I made this myself, too.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:09.960
I had no idea!

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:15.000
So my mom runs a variety store,

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:18.090
and she puts out the things I make.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.430
Then the teacher bought that?

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:21.430
Yeah.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.720
If you made it, then...

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.680
I don't think she knows.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.980
If she did, I doubt she'd wear it.

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:33.100
Th-Then she bought it
because she liked it!

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:34.110
Yeah.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.610
That's great! Totally great!

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:44.530
So this is the first time I've seen someone
buy something I made.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.490
And it was the teacher.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.040
I feel...

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:50.710
I feel really...

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:57.420
G-Good for you, Eiko!

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.170
Good for you!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:02.130
Sheesh, why are you crying, Hana?

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:05.260
S-Sorry. Sorry about that.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.060
Thank you, Hana.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:11.480
I'm touched.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:15.020
Eiko...

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:18.480
Okay!

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:20.440
Enough secret talk!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:25.700
Well, even if you did tell someone else,
it wouldn't cause any problems,

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:26.950
so don't worry about it.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:27.950
O-Okay.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.330
Actually,

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:33.330
this is the first time I've told someone
that I make accessories.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.250
You're the first, Hana.

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:44.880
I-Is it okay for me to be the first person
you told such a precious secret to?

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:46.140
What?

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:49.890
I think I made the right choice
telling you, Hana.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.770
<i>...I'd say it's because you made friends.</i>

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:59.520
<i>Was it really the right choice?</i>

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:01.530
<i>I hope so.</i>

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:05.700
<i>I wonder if I can do it someday...</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:08.870
<i>Share my secret with them...</i>
